                </a>
                <a href="https://x.com/FBIDirectorKash" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-sm px-3 social-follow-btn safe">
                    <i class="bi bi-twitter-x me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    Follow @FBIDirectorKash
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="socialCarousel" class="carousel slide carousel-fade" data-bs-ride="false">
            <div class="social-carousel__content-wrap">
                <div class="carousel-inner">
                    <div class="carousel-item active">
                        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 tweet-slide">
                                <div class="tweet-header mb-3">
                                    <img src="https://www.fbi.gov/fbi-homepage/director-patel.jpg" alt="FBI Director Kash Patel" class="tweet-avatar tweet-avatar--photo">
                                    <div class="tweet-account">
                                        <span class="tweet-name">
                                            FBI Director Kash Patel
                                            <i aria-label="Verified" class="bi bi-patch-check-fill tweet-verified "></i>
                                        </span>
                                        <span class="tweet-handle">@FBIDirectorKash</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <a href="https://x.com/FBIDirectorKash/status/2087953045384495343" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tweet-x-link safe" aria-label="View on Truth Social">
                                        <span class="tweet-x-view-label">View on</span>
                                        <i class="bi bi-twitter-x tweet-x-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <p class=" tweet-body">Led by President Trump and Vice President Vance, the FBI&#8217;s Most Wanted Fraudster list has seen unprecedented success&#8212;we&#8217;ve partnered with the <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="https://x.com/WHfraudTF" data-linktype="external" data-urltype="/view">@WHFraudTF</a> to arrest FOUR Most Wanted Fraudsters in less than 2 months. ... Today, we&#8217;re adding a new subject. Darren Anthony Robinson is wanted for his alleged involvement in an international investment fraud and money laundering scheme. From at least 2015 to June of 2023, Robinson engaged in a Ponzi-style scheme, running a purported professional investment company trading foreign currency, where he allegedly defrauded investors for $100 million in funds to illegally pay for expenses including his own personal lifestyle. ... The FBI is offering a reward of up to $150,000 for information leading to Robinson&#8217;s arrest and conviction. If you have any information, please call 1-800-CALL-FBI or visit <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="https://tips.fbi.gov" data-linktype="external" data-urltype="/view">tips.fbi.gov</a>.</p>
                                <p class="tweet-body"></p>
                                <span class="tweet-date mt-2 d-block">August 13, 2026</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                                <a href="https://x.com/FBIDirectorKash/status/2087953045384495343" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="about-video-link safe" aria-label="View full post on X">
                                    <div class="about-video-wrap">
                                        <img src="https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/social-carousel-image-2-072426.png" class="about-video-thumb">
                                        <!-- TODO: This icon should be under some kind of tal:condition-->
                                        <!-- TODO: There should be under some kind of tal:condition governing the playbutton thinggy-->
                                        
                                        <div class="about-video-label">
                                            <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-1"></i>
                                            
                                            
                                            View full post on X
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="carousel-item ">
                        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 tweet-slide">
                                <div class="tweet-header mb-3">
                                    <img src="https://www.fbi.gov/fbi-homepage/fbi_seal_new.png" alt="FBI" class="tweet-avatar tweet-avatar--photo">
                                    <div class="tweet-account">
                                        <span class="tweet-name">
                                            FBI
                                            <i aria-label="Verified" class="bi bi-patch-check-fill tweet-verified "></i>
                                        </span>
                                        <span class="tweet-handle">@FBI</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <a href="https://x.com/FBI/status/2087630409374863794" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tweet-x-link safe" aria-label="View on Truth Social">
                                        <span class="tweet-x-view-label">View on</span>
                                        <i class="bi bi-twitter-x tweet-x-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <p class=" tweet-body">Week after week, FBI teams across the country remain committed to confronting the most egregious threats. In the last two months, Operation Summer Heat has resulted in over: 4,000 arrests, 1,500 indictments, 2,500 recovered weapons, 3,300 kg of cocaine seized. Last week, our Safe Streets teams contributed to the arrests of 3 Mexican Mafia members following their 2023 convictions for murder, as well as the arrest of a member of the Rich Kings, a neighborhood-based street gang in Houston. ... We all joined the Bureau with the same dedication in mind&#8212;operations like Summer Heat demonstrate that commitment every day. We&#8217;ll continue pushing forward to safeguard the public&#8212;one operation at a time.</p>
                                <p class="tweet-body"></p>
                                <span class="tweet-date mt-2 d-block">August 12, 2026</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
