                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <p class=" tweet-body">NEWS ALERT from <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="https://www.x.com/fbinewark" data-linktype="external" data-urltype="/view">@FBINewark</a>: Rey E. Grabato II has been added to the #FBI Most Wanted Fraudsters List. Grabato is wanted for conspiracy to commit securities fraud, securities fraud, conspiracy to commit wire fraud, wire fraud, and conspiracy to defraud the U.S. with respect to tax. Anyone with information about the whereabouts of this fugitive can submit tips at <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="https://tips.fbi.gov" data-linktype="external" data-urltype="/view">tips.fbi.gov</a>, by calling 1-800-CALL-FBI, or by contacting FBI Newark at 973-792-3000. Learn more: <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="95c9abca38a44575ae75ac8267463b43" data-linktype="internal" data-urltype="_direct_">fbi.gov/wanted/most-wa&#8230;</a></p>
                                <p class="tweet-body"></p>
