                                <p class=" tweet-body">You can have a "job" or choose a mission. Take a closer look inside <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="https://www.x.com/fbidetroit" data-linktype="external" data-urltype="/view">@FBIDetroit</a> to see how the FBI protects communities in Michigan and where your skills could make an impact. The #FBI offers you a career like no other. Do you have the fire to go further? Start your journey today by visiting <a class="tweet-mention href=" https: data-val="https://www.fbijobs.gov" data-linktype="external" data-urltype="/view">fbijobs.gov</a>.&#160;</p>
